# Reproducible checkouts across platforms: text is LF in the repository, binary
# assets are never converted. This removes a whole class of "it differs only on
# Windows" failures (see the encoding lesson in docs/BUILDING.md).
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary
*.ogv binary
*.avi binary

*.svg text eol=lf
